        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Extract the pm2_5 values and time from source\nconst input = $('Source 1').first().json;\nconst times = input.hourly.time;\nconst pm2_5s = input.hourly.pm2_5;\n\n// Initialize result array\nconst records = [];\n\n// Process starting from the third hour (index 2)\nfor (let i = 2; i < pm2_5s.length; i++) {\n  const current_pm2_5 = pm2_5s[i];\n  const prev1_pm2_5 = pm2_5s[i - 1];\n  const prev2_pm2_5 = pm2_5s[i - 2];\n\n  // Calculate maximum over the three hours\n  const max_pm2_5 = Math.max(current_pm2_5, prev1_pm2_5, prev2_pm2_5);\n\n  records.push({\n    time: times[i],\n    pm2_5: current_pm2_5,\n    pm2_5_peak_3h: max_pm2_5\n  });\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { records } }];"
      },
